The `re-EMBER_verify` tool in this directory links against CGAL, which
is available under GPL / LGPL / commercial license.  The core `reember_lib`
and CLI `re-EMBER` are MIT-licensed and do not depend on CGAL.

Building this optional verifier tool adds GPL dependencies to the resulting
binary.  The verifier is not required to use the core boolean library and
is disabled by default in the build system.
